Um, [NOISE] house with, uh,

00:02:34.805 --> 00:02:37.550
that size, with that price,

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:45.035
[NOISE] and so on.

00:02:45.035 --> 00:02:51.490
Okay? Um, and maybe more conventionally if you plot this data,

